Rationale: The claim states that the high security prison holding one of the two arrestees from the 18 September 2014 counter-terrorism raid opened in the year 2001. However, the evidence indicates that HM Prison Maghaberry, a high security prison, opened in 1986. There is no reliable evidence confirming that the prison in question opened in 2001 or that it is holding one of the arrestees from the 2014 raid. Additionally, the other evidence sources do not provide any relevant information to support the claim.
